r\u2019s purchase. For example, Amazon\u2019s cookie lasts 24 hours, while some software tools offer 30\u201390 days.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/affiliate-marketing\/#faq-question-1759596731925","position":11,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/affiliate-marketing\/#faq-question-1759596731925","name":"Can affiliate marketing be combined with other income methods?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Many creators combine affiliate marketing with ads, sponsorships, freelancing, or selling their own products. This makes their income more stable and diversified.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/affiliate-marketing\/#faq-question-1759596743080","position":12,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/affiliate-marketing\/#faq-question-1759596743080","name":"Is affiliate marketing passive income?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes and no. Initially, it requires active work, including creating content and building traffic. Over time, once your blogs or videos rank, they can generate sales passively without much daily effort.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/affiliate-marketing\/#faq-question-1759596754648","position":13,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/affiliate-marketing\/#faq-question-1759596754648","name":"Can I do affiliate marketing without writing blogs?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Alternatives include YouTube videos, Instagram reels, Pinterest boards, podcasts, and even paid ads. Writing helps, but it\u2019s not the only option.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"}]}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/14721","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https